From 071b67e81ec5b7538dcb99a65ec323cfb5fa4b6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nick Sl <335926735+nickslkr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:03:37 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/22] media: sunxi: sun6i-mipi-csi2: add A523 support

Add a per-SoC variant layer while preserving the existing A31 register programming.

Add support for the A523 CSI-2 receiver port register layout, including lane mapping, lane count, CSI-2 data type, trigger configuration and port enable/disable handling.

Unlike the A31 implementation, the A523 variant does not require the fixed 297 MHz module clock rate.

Signed-off-by: Nick Sl <335926735+nickslkr@users.noreply.github.com>
---
